commit 0d8ed72d
author: cdvankammen
date: 2026-10-22 14:04:00 -0600
subject: docs: fix plans-and-prompts gitignore — track knowledge base, keep temp/ secrets out

- Removed stray '/docs/plans-and-prompts' (line 92) that defeated the
  intentional '!docs/plans-and-prompts/**' negation — the knowledge base is
  meant to be tracked (README/AGENTS.md conventions)
- Added targeted ignore for temp/ (contains live API keys — dialagram
  credentials; README forbids secrets in the knowledge base)
- Now tracks 10 previously-missing docs: ADR-007, learnings (stale-server,
  messages-audit, sr-cleanup), research (21-messages-audit, message-capture
  v2/log-viewing), workflows (README, e2e-testing, smart-router-testing)


